    "scent_leaf_desc":"Scent Leaf is a perennial herb in the Lamiaceae family. It has green, broad, slightly serrated leaves rich in essential oils, giving it a strong, peppery aroma. The plant grows to about 1-2 meters tall with small, white to pale purple flowers at the stem tops.",
