     "waterleaf_econo": "Water leaf is a key ingredient in Yoruba dishes, where it adds a rich, moist texture and nutritional value. It is also used in salads, soups, and sauces. Medicinally, water leaf is valued for its ability to lower blood pressure, manage diabetes, and improve digestion due to its high water and fiber content.",
